<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>每日老年痴呆 - 沙雕园</title><link>https://blog.shadiao.win/tags/%E6%AF%8F%E6%97%A5%E8%80%81%E5%B9%B4%E7%97%B4%E5%91%86/</link><description>欢迎来到沙雕园。本博客要素较多，包括但不限于数学、编程、游戏、吐槽、冲塔、科普、整活。</description><language>zh-cn</language><atom:link href="https://blog.shadiao.win/tags/%E6%AF%8F%E6%97%A5%E8%80%81%E5%B9%B4%E7%97%B4%E5%91%86/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>#每日老年痴呆 #每日奇遇 坐飞机，正美滋滋地坐着候机，一个穿制…</title><link>https://blog.shadiao.win/moments/closed-social-114900728958867831/</link><guid>https://blog.shadiao.win/moments/closed-social-114900728958867831/</guid><description>&lt;p>&lt;a href="https://thu.closed.social/tags/%E6%AF%8F%E6%97%A5%E8%80%81%E5%B9%B4%E7%97%B4%E5%91%86" rel="noopener noreferrer">#&lt;span>每日老年痴呆&lt;/span>&lt;/a> &lt;a href="https://thu.closed.social/tags/%E6%AF%8F%E6%97%A5%E5%A5%87%E9%81%87" rel="noopener noreferrer">#&lt;span>每日奇遇&lt;/span>&lt;/a> 坐飞机，正美滋滋地坐着候机，一个穿制服的人走过来叫我，我还以为我发表什么正义言论被查水表了，结果人家递给我一个行李箱，然后扬长而去。我这才发现我忘了拿行李箱，甚至想不起来在哪落下的，应该是安检完了就忘了拿，并且我一直没发现。也不知道他怎么找到我的，看了监控一路找过来吗 &lt;img src="https://blog.shadiao.win/closed-social-emoji/630adb3280013865f421.png" alt=":tv50:" title=":tv50:" class="closed-social-emoji" width="24" height="24" style="display:inline-block;width:1.3em;height:1.3em;margin:0;vertical-align:-.2em;border-radius:0">&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>#每日摸鱼 #摸鱼之道 #每日老年痴呆 上班儿时听有声儿小说儿，…</title><link>https://blog.shadiao.win/moments/closed-social-112750352559650120/</link><guid>https://blog.shadiao.win/moments/closed-social-112750352559650120/</guid><description>&lt;p>&lt;a href="https://thu.closed.social/tags/%E6%AF%8F%E6%97%A5%E6%91%B8%E9%B1%BC" rel="noopener noreferrer">#&lt;span>每日摸鱼&lt;/span>&lt;/a> &lt;a href="https://thu.closed.social/tags/%E6%91%B8%E9%B1%BC%E4%B9%8B%E9%81%93" rel="noopener noreferrer">#&lt;span>摸鱼之道&lt;/span>&lt;/a> &lt;a href="https://thu.closed.social/tags/%E6%AF%8F%E6%97%A5%E8%80%81%E5%B9%B4%E7%97%B4%E5%91%86" rel="noopener noreferrer">#&lt;span>每日老年痴呆&lt;/span>&lt;/a> &lt;br>上班儿时听有声儿小说儿，经常跟不上剧情，听得云里雾里。最近意识到是出场人物多了，我大脑处理不了 &lt;img src="https://blog.shadiao.win/closed-social-emoji/2ed4d525f5ad0fdaa44f.png" alt=":annoyingdog:" title=":annoyingdog:" class="closed-social-emoji" width="24" height="24" style="display:inline-block;width:1.3em;height:1.3em;margin:0;vertical-align:-.2em;border-radius:0"> 于是开了个excel文档来记笔记，果然效果拔群&lt;br>&lt;a href="https://youtube.com/playlist?list=PLuAi1i-ecNFEfToVXIFY3VreFfOZK8Ppk" rel="noopener noreferrer">&lt;span>https://&lt;/span>&lt;span>youtube.com/playlist?list=PLuA&lt;/span>&lt;span>i1i-ecNFEfToVXIFY3VreFfOZK8Ppk&lt;/span>&lt;/a>&lt;/p>
